    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Aas Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikaarei ipukat Peka lokoku a Remalia Isirael, kisyak Aas lokoku keŋ a Yosam akipuka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru ka Aas ŋatomoniarei isyakini akipuka Yudaya. Abu iŋes kipuka Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋikanikapei. Pa etiyae iŋes ŋuna etalakarito Ekapolon Akuj keŋ, lopite ŋolo etiyaa Daudi ŋolo arae papaa keŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai abu iŋes kiwuap epite ŋolo a ŋirwosi a Isirael. Abu tari kisitor lokoku keŋ kidiŋ akim, iwuapit ŋitalyo ŋulu aronok ŋulu a ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋuna abu Ekapolon kirita apaki ŋina adolunioto Ŋisirael nakwap ŋina aya ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes tomuro ka inanak ŋainakineta aneni elipeneneere ŋakujo ka alokamukumukui ta alokwap ŋikito ca daadaŋ ŋulu alibito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Potu nai ŋirwosi lu ŋiarei Resin ŋolo ka Aram ka Peka lokoku a Remalia ŋolo a Isirael akitijiore Aas alo Yerusalem. Kirikaut ikes Aas, nai nyepedosi akiloun iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa ŋul, abu erwosit ŋolo ke Edom torem etaun Elas, kirita a nen ŋituŋa a Yudaya kinyakasi ŋituŋa ŋulu ke Edom Elas tari tokona iboiyete a nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit Aas kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni ke erwosit Tigilaspilese a ŋolo ka Asiriya alimokin ebe, “Iyoŋ irae ekapolon kaŋ ka papa kaŋ. Bua toiunae ayoŋ aneni a ŋirwosi a ŋiarei a ŋulu ekeŋarunito akitijiore. Ŋirwosi ŋul; ikes Resin ŋolo ka Aram ka Peka ŋolo a Isirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolemu Aas esilipa ka egolid ŋolo ayai Kai ka Akuj kaapei ka ŋiboro ŋulu ajokak ŋulu alokai ke erwosit, kiyakiya erae ainakinet neni ke erwosit a ŋolo ka Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya tocamu ŋakiro ka Aas, tosodi min torem Damasko kikama. Torik ŋituŋa, ya Kir lotaun ŋolo ka akwap keŋ, ido toar Resin ŋolo arae erwosit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ilaar erwosit Aas Damasko aanyun erwosit Tigilaspilese ŋolo ka Asiriya, kiŋolik Namuroet ŋina ayai Damasko. Toroko iŋes Namuroet ŋin, kiyakik esacaradoti ŋolo anyaritae Uria etorube ŋolo a Namuroet a ŋin ikwaan per ka Namuroet ŋina abu iŋes kiŋolik alo Damasko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok esacaradoti Uria Namuroet isikwaanikinit ke etorube ŋolo eyakikini erwosit Aas iŋes alo Damasko. Toduku jik Uria Namuroet ŋin ikwaan per ke etorube ŋolo eyakikinio iŋes kirikak eriŋa erwosit Aas nyeboŋuno alo Damasko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eboŋuni erwosit Aas alo Damasko, kiŋolik Namuroet ŋin, toapiya diyete keŋ, tosodi todoka kidiama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak ŋainakineta keŋ ŋuna epeiyo nen, ŋikinyom ka ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋimaten, ido towuatak ŋaokot a ainakinet a ŋina a aŋaleu Namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema iŋes Namuroet ŋinaŋorot ŋina a eburonis alokiŋaren Akai ka Akuj, anakibois a ŋina alokidiŋ Namuroet ŋina kitete ka Akai ka Akuj kiwuak lowae ŋolo alo Kuju Namuroet ŋina kitete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai erwosit Aas neni a Uria a ŋolo arae esacaradoti ebe, “Kitiya nu Namuroet ŋina apolon ŋinakitete na; inanak ŋainakineta ŋuna ka ataparacu ŋuna epeiyo ka ŋuna a ŋikinyom ŋuna ke eboŋ, ŋainakineta ŋuna ke erwosit ŋuna epeiyo ka ŋuna a ŋikinyom keŋ ka ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋituŋa ŋuna epeiyo ka ŋuna a ŋikinyom kec kaapei ka ŋainakineta kec ŋuna a ŋimaten. Towuatanak Namuroet ŋaokot daadaŋ ŋuna a ŋainakineta a ŋuna epeiyo ka ŋuna a ŋajul. Nai Namuroet ŋina a eburonis, iŋes esitiyae ayoŋ akiŋitununuya ŋakiro ŋuna acamit ayenun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiya esacaradoti Uria lopite ŋolo aris erwosit Aasia kicikia iŋes akitiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema erwosit Aas ŋakito ŋuna apesitae nawae a Akai ka Akuj kaapei ka ŋabesenio ŋuna aya nawoeta ŋuna ejukanaryo. Tolemana iŋes etorube ŋolo ka anam ŋolo etiyaunitae a eburonis ŋolo ayai kwap ŋitorubei a ŋimoŋin a ŋitomon ka ŋiarei a ŋulu etiyaunitae a eburonis. Abu iŋes kiwuak etorube a anam ŋol neni adukunitoe a ŋamoru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nabo tolema eripipi ŋolo esitiyaeneneo akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, ŋolo sek adukokinitae Kai ka Akuj ka togol alo Kai ka Akuj ekek ŋolo alokiŋa, ŋolo sek etorenenee erwosit. Etiyae iŋes ŋakiro ŋun akitalakaria erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ka Aas ŋuluce daadaŋ igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwana Aas, tonukae akuwan keŋ neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ, alotaun a Daudi. Kilunyokin Esekia ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
